{
    "$comment": "Shared fixtures for functions/shared/applicationRules.js and src/config/applicationRules.js. Both suites run every vector; editing one implementation without the other fails the other suite. `today` is fixed so expiry and coverage are deterministic. Codes are listed in evaluation order.",
